{"4968620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "After Eternity", "steam_appid": 4968620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overflowing with Supernatural Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The end of the known universe is coming. Most humans find peace, but a terrible few cling onto the idea of creating another world, restarting from the beginning, or sacrificing others to extend their own lives. Outside in the Dark Forest, abysmal monstrosities wait for a moment of weakness. Inside our own sheltered galaxy we forget what it means to be human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a universe that runs along the edge of a cyberpunk dystopia. What does it mean to be human when simulations, cybernetics, and reality-breaking drugs dominate? This is the duty of an inquisitor: to filter the human from the inhuman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968620/extras/9fcae51a248cd85a0c012913fdd79be8.poster.avif?t=1787925677\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968620/extras/9fcae51a248cd85a0c012913fdd79be8.webm?t=1787925677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968620/extras/9fcae51a248cd85a0c012913fdd79be8.mp4?t=1787925677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Classic Single-player Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'After Eternity' is a single-player story-rich game that offers a primarily linear experience. Players with keen eyes and sharp minds will find optional content in the form of: weapon upgrades and in-depth lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968620/extras/880c7a163a11bd13bc3b094336f381b9.poster.avif?t=1787925677\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968620/extras/880c7a163a11bd13bc3b094336f381b9.webm?t=1787925677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968620/extras/880c7a163a11bd13bc3b094336f381b9.mp4?t=1787925677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slash, Shoot, &amp; Stomp</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash monsters with vibrating hypersteel, shoot them with a powerful selection of guns, and when everything else fails: stomp their skulls into mush to end the onslaught. Be prepared when rooms go into lockdown and swarms of monsters emerge. A real inquisitor knows when to save their stimulants and when to spend them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968620/extras/6dde0cbfff9232f6cc6ef30f83e7162d.poster.avif?t=1787925677\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968620/extras/6dde0cbfff9232f6cc6ef30f83e7162d.webm?t=1787925677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968620/extras/6dde0cbfff9232f6cc6ef30f83e7162d.mp4?t=1787925677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Old School Fixed Cameras</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calling back to retro horror titles of the past 'After Eternity' uses fixed camera perspective, dithered textures, and low-poly models to bring back 90s video game horror. Prepare yourself for long dark corridors, screeching monsters, and Dutch angle weirdness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best played with a controller, but perfectly playable with mouse and keyboard. Classic tank-controls are available alongside more modern control inputs, aim-assist, re-bindings, and camera settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968620/extras/205aaf23033b1412d4e348055f635ddc.poster.avif?t=1787925677\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968620/extras/205aaf23033b1412d4e348055f635ddc.webm?t=1787925677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968620/extras/205aaf23033b1412d4e348055f635ddc.mp4?t=1787925677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Ode to Sci-fi</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get ready for a haunting experience. Horror and beauty blend together in stunning wide shots of mega-structures, dying-supernovas, and endless machines. Hop from space-stations to abandoned city-planets to distorted dimensions beyond our wildest nightmares. Diegetic UI allows for total immersion in the dark and cinematic universe of 'After Eternity'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968620/extras/90c47bb852fad0a9762cf5293f21d7b9.poster.avif?t=1787925677\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968620/extras/90c47bb852fad0a9762cf5293f21d7b9.webm?t=1787925677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968620/extras/90c47bb852fad0a9762cf5293f21d7b9.mp4?t=1787925677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overflowing with Supernatural Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The end of the known universe is coming. Most humans find peace, but a terrible few cling onto the idea of creating another world, restarting from the beginning, or sacrificing others to extend their own lives. Outside in the Dark Forest, abysmal monstrosities wait for a moment of weakness. Inside our own sheltered galaxy we forget what it means to be human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a universe that runs along the edge of a cyberpunk dystopia. What does it mean to be human when simulations, cybernetics, and reality-breaking drugs dominate? This is the duty of an inquisitor: to filter the human from the inhuman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968620/extras/9fcae51a248cd85a0c012913fdd79be8.poster.avif?t=1787925677\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968620/extras/9fcae51a248cd85a0c012913fdd79be8.webm?t=1787925677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968620/extras/9fcae51a248cd85a0c012913fdd79be8.mp4?t=1787925677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Classic Single-player Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'After Eternity' is a single-player story-rich game that offers a primarily linear experience. Players with keen eyes and sharp minds will find optional content in the form of: weapon upgrades and in-depth lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.